    "body": "http://www.umassonline.net/ is a page that renders differently between browsers. Firefox has more space above the fieldset/legend (\"Step 1: Your Contact Details\") compared to Safari and Chrome. Edge has as much space as Firefox, but the fieldset background is shown above the legend.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"874\" alt=\"screen shot 2018-08-23 at 14 40 53\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/244772/44525869-a2dcd000-a6e2-11e8-9f20-958794a1d9e4.png\">\r\n",
